msgid "Ranger"
msgstr "Ranger"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:109
msgid ""
"The Exuari Ranger is a special artillery sniper designed to deal large "
"amounts of damage quickly and from a distance before escaping. Despite being "
"a basic design and among the smallest corvette-class ships, it also carries "
"nuclear weapons."
msgstr "The Exuari Ranger is a special artillery sniper designed to deal large amounts of damage quickly and from a distance before escaping. Despite being a basic design and among the smallest corvette-class ships, it also carries nuclear weapons."

